{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Biomass consists of organic material such as wood, agricultural residues or specially grown crops. It can be burnt to provide heat or electricity, or processed into biofuels. Biomass can be renewable when harvested and replenished responsibly, but it is not automatically carbon-neutral or sustainable. Growing, harvesting, transporting and burning biomass can cause greenhouse gas emissions, land-use change and competition with food production.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 31.346939, "words": [["Biomass", 0.0], ["consists", 0.766], ["of", 1.486], ["organic", 1.718], ["material", 2.322], ["such", 2.914], ["as", 3.193], ["wood,", 3.413], ["agricultural", 3.959], ["residues", 4.981], ["or", 5.642], ["specially", 5.84], ["grown", 6.467], ["crops.", 6.803], ["It", 7.442], ["can", 7.663], ["be", 7.872], ["burnt", 8.034], ["to", 8.336], ["provide", 8.475], ["heat", 8.986], ["or", 9.358], ["electricity,", 9.578], ["or", 10.623], ["processed", 10.844], ["into", 11.447], ["biofuels.", 11.749], ["Biomass", 12.759], ["can", 13.514], ["be", 13.735], ["renewable", 13.92], ["when", 14.571], ["harvested", 14.826], ["and", 15.523], ["replenished", 15.777], ["responsibly,", 16.462], ["but", 17.473], ["it", 17.728], ["is", 17.867], ["not", 18.053], ["automatically", 18.332], ["carbon-neutral", 19.388], ["or", 20.491], ["sustainable.", 20.7], ["Growing,", 21.699], ["harvesting,", 22.43], ["transporting", 23.219], ["and", 24.079], ["burning", 24.346], ["biomass", 24.787], ["can", 25.565], ["cause", 25.855], ["greenhouse", 26.273], ["gas", 26.83], ["emissions,", 27.109], ["land-use", 27.863], ["change", 28.467], ["and", 29.024], ["competition", 29.315], ["with", 29.976], ["food", 30.185], ["production.", 30.452]], "raw": [{"text": "Biomass", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.697}, {"text": "consists", "start": 0.766, "end": 1.416}, {"text": "of", "start": 1.486, "end": 1.591}, {"text": "organic", "start": 1.718, "en